The 2024–25 season was the 76th season in the history of the [[UD Las Palmas]] and the club's second consecutive season in [[2024–25 La Liga|La Liga]]. In addition to the domestic league, the team participated in the [[2024–25 Copa del Rey|Copa del Rey]].

